  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> là tâm của đáy, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. Do đó\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>S</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/dc56a934ac15dfc45ef53fe9de49a20f9b2ffddfa03a5ff9126ba0b363ed02c0.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
